%% Product audit — full flow

flowchart TD
    start([/product-audit in a project root]) --> understand[Read one guide, status record,<br/>PROFILE and last RESUME.md]
    understand --> resume{Unfinished run?}
    resume -->|yes| cont[Resume its RESUME.md next step]
    resume -->|no| target[Confirm target identity<br/>from project-live-urls.json]
    target --> manifest[Manifest + applicability<br/>coverage.md: every check ID]
    manifest --> res{resource-aware-dispatch<br/>allows lanes?}
    res -->|yes| lanes[3 read-only lanes in parallel:<br/>security · experience · discoverability]
    res -->|no| seq[Run lanes in sequence<br/>in the main context]
    lanes --> integrate
    seq --> integrate
    cont --> integrate
    integrate[Integrate: de-duplicate, root causes,<br/>findings.json + P0-P3 backlog] --> ask{Owner-only or<br/>outcome-changing questions?}
    ask -->|yes| batch[One AskUserQuestion batch;<br/>record answers]
    ask -->|no| mode
    batch --> mode{Mode}
    mode -->|audit| report
    mode -->|full / fix| waves[Fix waves P0 to P3:<br/>dummy first, one writer per file,<br/>project gates]
    waves --> verify[Re-run each fixed check<br/>on the final code]
    verify -->|fails| waves
    verify -->|passes| ship[Commit, push, deploy per grants]
    ship --> live[Live re-verification:<br/>render 1440/390, bundle hash]
    live -->|fails| waves
    live --> report[REPORT.md before to after,<br/>RESUME.md, MANUAL-TASKS.md,<br/>completion audit gaps]
    report --> done([Push record repo; report to owner])
